ns  than others because of their duties  climate change hasn't yet led to a large  decline in energy use as scientists say  will be needed  but wars have a way of bringing home  urgency and losing political constraints  including on asking people to make  energy sacrifices  this is net zero i'm akshat rathi follow  us on your favorite platforms  you
 

